      "content": "The thing is, we didn't actually do a formal power calculation beforehand because the recruitment was so difficult. With only 12 participants, I'm worried they're just going to see it as a weak study and reject it outright. How can we frame this section so it doesn't look like we just failed to get enough subjects?",
